				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-579398#post-1930746</guid>
				<title>Re: What happened with wondertainment</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-579398/how-dr-clef-saved-christmas#post-1930746</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2014 09:02:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Smapti</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>362048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The scene with Wondertainment and Nobody isn't really part of the main story per se. I wanted to include a scene showing how people in a world where Santa exists would react to his absence (i.e. the toy stores get mobbed because in the past they've never had to sell this many toys in December), and I decided to frame it around those two as sort of an in-joke.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
