						 <p>I wanted to hate this for being too in-jokey, too chowdery (I didn't even know what chowder <em>was</em>), too silly, and altogether too American&#8230; but I just couldn't. It's the mark of a great writer to take individual elements the reader hates and make them still love the final piece. Smapti, you da man.</p> <p>Seafood soup on very fine, indeed&#8230;! How I could not upvote that?</p> 
				 	]]>
